      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLYING SAUCER (2) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fifth (17.75) last time in a Grade 5 at Taree Super Track. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Can atone. SUPER QUALITY (8) turned in a moderate effort last time when sixth at Gosford over 388m behind Kilcoy Tiger (23.12) in a Grade 5. Placed at her previous run. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Has ability and is one of the better chances. GARY INDIANA (3) was well back throughout but attacked the line strongly to place, 8 lengths from the winner (23.57) at this track in Grade 5. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and three minor placings to his credit. Can feature again. ZUMA ZESTA (1) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at his latest outing at this circuit.",
